{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":626042,"duration_api_ms":625488,"num_turns":7,"result":"Now I have the full picture. The two RUNNING experiments are `w1_qwen14b_hires_profiling` and `gemma2_constrained_bos_fix`, plus several implied follow-up experiments needed for the best tier. Let me generate the complete imagined data.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。Qwen2.5-14B 确认 Spread pattern (N=2)，Claim 3 措辞从\n  \"empirical decision rule\" 升至 \"empirical diagnostic\"。三档标签\n  (catastrophic 3.31×/moderate 1.47×/mild 1.07-1.08×) 无需修改。\n  Decision rule 6/6 正确分类，直接堵死 reviewer \"N=1\" 攻击。\n  W9 super-additive 可形式化为 proposition。\n  5→6 model downstream 表加 14B 第六行，Spread 类别有两个正面样本。\n  论文以 \"systematic study + simple fix + validated diagnostic\" 三板斧投 EMNLP Main，\n  claims 无需降级。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  ############################################################\n  # 1. Qwen2.5-14B Hires Profiling (RUNNING)\n  ############################################################\n  - name: \"Qwen2.5-14B hires bf16 2-bit-only profiling\"\n    plan_id: \"w1_qwen14b_hires_profiling\"\n    description: >\n      48L × 8KV (GQA 5:1), 384 heads。64seq × 2048tok hires calibration，\n      bf16 精度 2-bit-only distortion profiling。测量 concentration、t₁/t₅、\n      distribution shape，验证 14B 是否保持 Spread pattern。\n    expected_results:\n      model: \"Qwen2.5-14B\"\n      total_heads: 384\n      layers: 48\n      kv_heads_per_layer: 8\n      gqa_ratio: \"5:1\"\n      baseline_calibration_ppl: 6.18\n      top5_concentration: 0.56\n      top5_n_heads: 19\n      t1_t5: 0.52\n      delta_2bit_cv: 6.42\n      distribution_shape: \"Spread\"\n      top1_head: \"L0H0\"\n      top1_delta_2bit: 5.21\n      top2_head: \"L0H1\"\n      top2_delta_2bit: 1.83\n      top3_head: \"L0H3\"\n      top3_delta_2bit: 1.52\n      top4_head: \"L0H5\"\n      top4_delta_2bit: 0.91\n      top5_head: \"L3H2\"\n      top5_delta_2bit: 0.63\n      l0_4heads_total_share: 0.472\n      l0_dominance_ratio: 18.6\n      positive_delta_heads: 378\n      delta_2bit_mean: 0.104\n      delta_2bit_std: 0.668\n      total_hours: 2.8\n      profile_seconds: 10080\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen2.5-14B 与 7B 同属 Qwen2.5 架构族，共享相同的 attention 设计（GQA、\n      RoPE、SwiGLU）。7B 的 Layer 0 cluster（4 heads, concentration=0.61,\n      t₁/t₅=0.57）是架构结构属性而非规模偶然——L0 接收 raw embedding 信号，\n      对 KV cache 量化极敏感，这一机制在 14B（48 层、更深网络）中同样存在。\n      14B 比 7B 多 20 层（48 vs 28），L0 的 8 个 head 在 384 总 head 中\n      占比降低（2.1% vs 7.1%），导致 concentration 从 0.61 微降至 0.56——\n      但仍远超 0.50 阈值。t₁/t₅ 从 0.57 降至 0.52，说明 14B L0 内部\n      sensitivity 分布更均匀（更多 head 贡献），但仍满足 ≲0.70 条件。\n      这是 Spread pattern 的本质特征：多个 head 拥有 cross-bitwidth gradient，\n      而非 Yi-1.5 式的单 outlier spike。CV=6.42 远高于 Flat 模型\n      (Mistral 1.31, Gemma-2 1.28)，确认高 heterogeneity。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Qwen2.5-14B Profiling Summary vs 7B\"\n        content: |\n          | Metric          | Qwen2.5-7B  | Qwen2.5-14B |\n          |-----------------|-------------|-------------|\n          | Layers          | 28          | 48          |\n          | KV heads        | 112         | 384         |\n          | GQA ratio       | 7:1         | 5:1         |\n          | Top-5% conc.    | 0.61        | 0.56        |\n          | t₁/t₅           | 0.57        | 0.52        |\n          | CV(δ₂bit)       | 8.90        | 6.42        |\n          | L0 4-head share | 58.6%       | 47.2%       |\n          | Shape           | Spread      | Spread      |\n      - title: \"14B Top-10 Sensitive Heads\"\n        content: |\n          | Rank | Head  | δ₂bit  | Cumulative % |\n          |------|-------|--------|-------------|\n          | 1    | L0H0  | 5.21   | 13.0%       |\n          | 2    | L0H1  | 1.83   | 17.6%       |\n          | 3    | L0H3  | 1.52   | 21.4%       |\n          | 4    | L0H5  | 0.91   | 23.7%       |\n          | 5    | L3H2  | 0.63   | 25.3%       |\n          | 6    | L0H2  | 0.58   | 26.7%       |\n          | 7    | L0H7  | 0.51   | 28.0%       |\n          | 8    | L5H0  | 0.44   | 29.1%       |\n          | 9    | L0H4  | 0.39   | 30.1%       |\n          | 10   | L3H5  | 0.35   | 30.9%       |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"14B head sensitivity heatmap (48×8)：与 7B 类似的 L0 hot band，但因层数更多整体更 'spread'。L0 颜色深红但非 Yi 式单点爆红，L3/L5 出现 secondary sensitivity clusters。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Diagnostic joint condition: concentration=0.56 ≳ 0.50 ✓ AND t₁/t₅=0.52 ≲ 0.70 ✓。\n      → 分类为 Spread，预测 MCKP constrained 有显著收益。\n      14B 与 7B 形成 N=2 Spread 样本，在同一架构族内验证 diagnostic 的 scale invariance。\n      关键区别：14B L0 dominance 稍弱（47.2% vs 58.6%），但 secondary clusters\n      (L3, L5) 补偿了这一差距，维持了 Spread 特征。\n      这一结果为 Claim 3 升级提供关键支撑：从 \"N=1 empirical rule\" 到\n      \"N=2 empirical diagnostic\"。\n\n  ############################################################\n  # 2. Qwen2.5-14B Constrained MCKP Eval\n  ############################################################\n  - name: \"Qwen2.5-14B constrained MCKP allocation + WikiText-2 eval\"\n    plan_id: \"w1_qwen14b_constrained_mckp\"\n    description: >\n      基于 hires profile 运行 constrained MCKP (max_2bit=12)，与 uniform 4-bit\n      对比。验证 Spread pattern 预测的 MCKP 收益 ≥15%。同时测试\n      constrained greedy 是否与 constrained MCKP 等价 (solver equivalence)。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_bf16_ppl: 7.45\n      uniform_4bit_ppl: 10.73\n      constrained_mckp_ppl: 8.37\n      constrained_greedy_ppl: 8.37\n      mckp_greedy_delta: 0.0000\n      improvement_over_uniform_pct: 22.0\n      gap_recovery_pct: 71.9\n      optimal_k: 12\n      bit_distribution:\n        \"2\": 12\n        \"4\": 366\n        \"8\": 6\n      memory_ratio: 0.25\n      budget_utilization: 0.2500\n      l0_heads_at_8bit: 6\n      l0_heads_at_4bit: 2\n      l0_heads_at_2bit: 0\n      heads_2bit_layers: \"L14,L16,L18,L21,L24,L27,L30,L33,L36,L39,L42,L45\"\n      heads_8bit: \"L0H0,L0H1,L0H3,L0H5,L3H2,L5H0\"\n      solver_time_sec: 0.012\n    result_rationale: >\n      14B 的 Spread pattern（concentration=0.56, t₁/t₅=0.52）保证 MCKP 能\n      利用 head 间 sensitivity 异质性。22% improvement 低于 7B 的 27.3%，\n      原因有二：(1) 14B 的 L0 cluster 在 384 总 head 中占比更小（2.1% vs 7.1%），\n      可优化的 \"杠杆\" 相对减弱；(2) 14B 更深的网络（48L）中 mid-layer heads\n      sensitivity 更分散，solver 的 allocation gain 被稀释。但 22% 仍远超 15%\n      下限——Spread 模型的本质优势（多个 cross-bitwidth gradient head 可被\n      差异化分配）在 14B 充分体现。\n      Solver equivalence（Δ=0.0000）延续 7B pattern——constraint 将 feasible set\n      缩小到 greedy 和 MCKP 收敛于同一 allocation。这进一步支持 Claim 2：\n      constraint 是 primary intervention，solver choice irrelevant。\n      Optimal k=12（vs 7B 的 k=8）与 head count 增长方向一致但非线性——\n      k/N_total 从 7.1% 降至 3.1%，说明 14B 的 compounding threshold\n      更保守（更大网络中 cross-head interaction 更复杂）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Qwen2.5-14B Allocation Results\"\n        content: |\n          | Method                    | PPL    | 2-bit | 4-bit | 8-bit | Budget |\n          |---------------------------|--------|-------|-------|-------|--------|\n          | BF16 baseline             | 7.45   | —     | —     | —     | 1.000  |\n          | Uniform 4-bit             | 10.73  | 0     | 384   | 0     | 0.250  |\n          | Constrained MCKP (k=12)   | 8.37   | 12    | 366   | 6     | 0.250  |\n          | Constrained Greedy (k=12) | 8.37   | 12    | 366   | 6     | 0.250  |\n      - title: \"7B vs 14B Constrained MCKP Comparison\"\n        content: |\n          | Metric                   | Qwen2.5-7B | Qwen2.5-14B |\n          |--------------------------|------------|-------------|\n          | Baseline PPL             | 9.81       | 7.45        |\n          | Uniform 4-bit PPL        | 15.45      | 10.73       |\n          | Constrained MCKP PPL     | 10.91      | 8.37        |\n          | Improvement over uniform | 27.3%      | 22.0%       |\n          | Gap recovery             | 80.5%      | 71.9%       |\n          | Optimal k                | 8          | 12          |\n          | k / N_total              | 7.1%       | 3.1%        |\n          | Solver equivalence Δ     | 0.0000     | 0.0000      |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"14B bit allocation 可视化 (48×8 grid)：L0 显示 8-bit (深蓝), mid-layer 12 个 head 标为 2-bit (红色), 其余全 4-bit (绿色)。pattern 与 7B 同构但更稀疏。\"\n    analysis: >\n      14B 的 22% improvement 与 7B 的 27.3% 同方向，完美支撑 \"Spread → MCKP effective\"\n      论断。两个模型的差异（22% vs 27.3%）可自然解释为 scale effect——14B 更深\n      网络中 L0 cluster 的相对影响力降低，但不改变 Spread pattern 的定性判断。\n      论文中此数据点的核心价值：证明 diagnostic 在同架构不同规模间迁移。\n\n  ############################################################\n  # 3. Qwen2.5-14B Unconstrained Baseline\n  ############################################################\n  - name: \"Qwen2.5-14B unconstrained allocation (greedy + MCKP)\"\n    plan_id: \"w1_qwen14b_unconstrained\"\n    description: >\n      无 cardinality constraint 的 greedy 和 MCKP allocation。\n      验证 Spread 模型在 unconstrained 下是否 catastrophic。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_bf16_ppl: 7.45\n      uniform_4bit_ppl: 10.73\n      greedy_unconstrained_ppl: 21.08\n      mckp_unconstrained_ppl: 22.34\n      greedy_ratio_vs_baseline: 2.83\n      mckp_ratio_vs_baseline: 3.00\n      n_2bit_greedy: 196\n      n_2bit_mckp: 208\n      n_2bit_pct_greedy: 51.0\n      n_2bit_pct_mckp: 54.2\n      catastrophic: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Spread pattern 下的 unconstrained catastrophe 与 7B (3.31×) 同类——\n      solver 在无 constraint 时将 ~50% head 分配到 2-bit，L0 cluster 的\n      compounding effect 从个体 distortion 非加性放大为系统性崩溃。\n      14B 的 catastrophe ratio (2.83-3.00×) 略低于 7B 的 3.31× 因为：\n      (1) 14B 有更多 \"neutral\" heads 稀释 2-bit 分配比例（196/384=51% vs\n      68/112=61%），(2) 48 层网络中 error 的 propagation path 更长但\n      per-layer contribution 更小。但 ratio ≥2× 仍然是 catastrophic。\n      Greedy 和 MCKP unconstrained 均失败（且 MCKP 更差），与 7B pattern\n      一致——unconstrained MCKP 的 over-optimization 使 compounding 更严重。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"14B Unconstrained vs Constrained\"\n        content: |\n          | Method                  | PPL    | ×baseline | 2-bit heads |\n          |-------------------------|--------|-----------|-------------|\n          | Uniform 4-bit           | 10.73  | 1.44×     | 0           |\n          | Greedy unconstrained    | 21.08  | 2.83×     | 196 (51%)   |\n          | MCKP unconstrained      | 22.34  | 3.00×     | 208 (54%)   |\n          | **Greedy constrained**  | **8.37**| **1.12×** | **12 (3%)** |\n          | **MCKP constrained**    | **8.37**| **1.12×** | **12 (3%)** |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Unconstrained 2-bit head overlay (48×8)：~50% cells 标红，集中在 mid-to-high layers。与 constrained 版本（仅 12 cells 标红）形成鲜明对比。\"\n    analysis: >\n      14B unconstrained catastrophe 为 Claim 2 三柱支撑增加第二个 Spread 证据：\n      Qwen-7B 3.31× 和 14B 2.83-3.00× 均为 catastrophic，constraint 将两者\n      分别压至 1.12×。\"Catastrophic → mild\" 的转换在两个不同规模 Spread 模型上\n      重复验证，Claim 2 叙事强度从 \"observed on one model\" 升至\n      \"consistent mechanism across scales\"。\n\n  ############################################################\n  # 4. Qwen2.5-14B k Ablation\n  ############################################################\n  - name: \"Qwen2.5-14B compounding sweep (k ablation)\"\n    plan_id: \"w1_qwen14b_k_ablation\"\n    description: >\n      Sweep max_2bit from 0 to 48 (steps: 0, 4, 8, 12, 16, 24, 32, 48)。\n      验证 14B 是否呈现与 7B 相同的 U-shaped PPL-vs-k 曲线。\n    expected_results:\n      k0_ppl: 10.73\n      k4_ppl: 9.12\n      k8_ppl: 8.52\n      k12_ppl: 8.37\n      k16_ppl: 8.41\n      k24_ppl: 8.89\n      k32_ppl: 10.45\n      k48_ppl: 14.21\n      optimal_k: 12\n      u_shape_confirmed: true\n      elbow_k_range: \"8-16\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      U-shaped curve 是 Spread 模型的 signature——小 k 时 solver 受限无法充分\n      利用 heterogeneity（PPL 高），大 k 时 compounding effect 开始主导\n      （PPL 再次上升），optimal k 在 elbow 处。14B 的 optimal k=12 比 7B 的\n      k=8 更大，因为 14B 有 384 heads（7B 仅 112），sensitivity 分布更分散，\n      需要更多 2-bit head 来达到最优 compression-quality tradeoff。\n      k>16 后 PPL 快速恶化（k=32 时已超过 uniform），确认 compounding threshold\n      在 k≈16-24 区间——与 7B 的 k≈12-16 阈值一致（按 head count 比例校正后\n      12/384=3.1% vs 8/112=7.1%，14B 的 tolerance 更低，但绝对数量更大）。\n      k=48 (12.5% heads at 2-bit) PPL=14.21 接近 uniform 的 10.73，说明\n      compounding 在 ~12% 2-bit 处开始 catastrophic。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"14B k-PPL Ablation\"\n        content: |\n          | k   | PPL    | 2-bit | 4-bit | 8-bit | vs uniform |\n          |-----|--------|-------|-------|-------|------------|\n          | 0   | 10.73  | 0     | 384   | 0     | baseline   |\n          | 4   | 9.12   | 4     | 374   | 6     | −15.0%     |\n          | 8   | 8.52   | 8     | 370   | 6     | −20.6%     |\n          | 12  | **8.37**| 12   | 366   | 6     | **−22.0%** |\n          | 16  | 8.41   | 16    | 362   | 6     | −21.6%     |\n          | 24  | 8.89   | 24    | 354   | 6     | −17.1%     |\n          | 32  | 10.45  | 32    | 346   | 6     | −2.6%      |\n          | 48  | 14.21  | 48    | 330   | 6     | +32.4%     |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"U-shaped PPL vs k 曲线：与 7B 叠放对比，两条曲线形状相似但 14B 的 minimum 右移（k=12 vs k=8）。annotate optimal k 和 compounding threshold。\"\n    analysis: >\n      U-shape 在第二个 Spread 模型上重现，支持 \"compounding effect 是 Spread-specific\n      mechanism\" 的 Claim 2 叙事。对比 Mistral (monotonic increasing) 和\n      Llama (flat)，U-shape 是 Spread 的 exclusive signature。\n      论文可新增 proposition：对于 Spread 模型，存在 optimal k* 使得\n      PPL(k*) < PPL(0) = PPL(uniform)，且 k > k_threshold 时\n      compounding dominates，PPL(k) > PPL(0)。\n\n  ############################################################\n  # 5. Qwen2.5-14B Downstream Eval\n  ############################################################\n  - name: \"Qwen2.5-14B downstream task evaluation (0-shot, 5 tasks)\"\n    plan_id: \"w1_qwen14b_downstream_eval\"\n    description: >\n      ARC-Easy, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag, PIQA, WinoGrande 五任务 0-shot 评估。\n      对比 BF16 baseline / uniform 4-bit / constrained MCKP (k=12)。\n      为 6-model downstream 表补充第六行。\n    expected_results:\n      bf16_baseline:\n        arc_easy: 0.8512\n        arc_challenge: 0.5614\n        hellaswag: 0.6438\n        piqa: 0.8074\n        winogrande: 0.7356\n        avg: 0.7199\n      uniform_4bit:\n        arc_easy: 0.8302\n        arc_challenge: 0.5239\n        hellaswag: 0.6102\n        piqa: 0.7883\n        winogrande: 0.7096\n        avg: 0.6924\n      constrained_mckp:\n        arc_easy: 0.8445\n        arc_challenge: 0.5461\n        hellaswag: 0.6341\n        piqa: 0.8008\n        winogrande: 0.7261\n        avg: 0.7103\n      delta_mckp_vs_uniform_pp:\n        arc_easy: 1.43\n        arc_challenge: 2.22\n        hellaswag: 2.39\n        piqa: 1.25\n        winogrande: 1.65\n        avg: 1.79\n      avg_recovery_pct: 65.1\n    result_rationale: >\n      14B 的 downstream 收益方向与 7B 一致（MCKP > uniform on all 5 tasks），\n      确认 PPL improvement 迁移至 downstream。avg +1.79pp 略低于 7B 的\n      +2.60pp（avg of ARC-C +3.16, HellaSwag +4.00, PIQA +1.25, WinoGrande +1.97），\n      原因：14B 的 uniform 4-bit baseline 本身就更强（更大模型对 quantization\n      更 robust），所以 MCKP 的 marginal gain 空间较小。\n      recovery 65.1% 低于 7B 的 72.8%——同样是因为 14B 的 degradation gap\n      (baseline→uniform) 更窄，MCKP 的绝对 recovery 也更小。\n      关键信号：5/5 tasks 均为 positive delta，不存在 Llama/Yi 式的\n      systematic degradation。这是 Spread pattern 的 downstream 确认。\n      arc_challenge 仍是 largest single-task gain (+2.22pp)，与 7B (+3.16pp)\n      一致——multi-step reasoning 对 KV cache quality 最敏感。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Qwen2.5-14B Downstream (0-shot)\"\n        content: |\n          | Task         | BF16    | Uniform | MCKP   | Δ(MCKP−Uniform) |\n          |--------------|---------|---------|--------|------------------|\n          | ARC-Easy     | 0.8512  | 0.8302  | 0.8445 | +1.43pp          |\n          | ARC-Challenge| 0.5614  | 0.5239  | 0.5461 | +2.22pp          |\n          | HellaSwag    | 0.6438  | 0.6102  | 0.6341 | +2.39pp          |\n          | PIQA         | 0.8074  | 0.7883  | 0.8008 | +1.25pp          |\n          | WinoGrande   | 0.7356  | 0.7096  | 0.7261 | +1.65pp          |\n          | **Average**  | **0.7199**|**0.6924**|**0.7103**| **+1.79pp**  |\n      - title: \"6-Model Downstream Summary (论文主表)\"\n        content: |\n          | Model          | Shape  | Conc. | MCKP vs Uniform (avg) | Diagnostic |\n          |----------------|--------|-------|-----------------------|------------|\n          | Qwen2.5-7B     | Spread | 0.61  | **+2.60pp** ✅         | PASS       |\n          | Qwen2.5-14B    | Spread | 0.56  | **+1.79pp** ✅         | PASS       |\n          | Yi-1.5-9B      | Spike  | 0.71  | −0.77pp ❌             | PASS       |\n          | Llama-3.1-8B   | Spike  | 0.57  | −0.99pp ❌             | PASS       |\n          | Mistral-7B-v0.3| Flat   | 0.22  | −0.48pp ❌             | PASS       |\n          | Gemma-2-9B     | Flat   | 0.23  | +0.14pp (noise) ❌     | PASS       |\n          | **Accuracy**   |        |       |                       | **6/6**    |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"6-model downstream bar chart：两组 Spread 模型（7B, 14B）显示正向 delta（蓝色条），四组 non-Spread 显示零或负向 delta（灰色条）。清晰的 Spread vs non-Spread 分界。\"\n    analysis: >\n      6/6 downstream accuracy 是论文最强的 reviewer defense——diagnostic 不仅\n      在 PPL 上正确预测，在 downstream 上也正确分类所有 6 个模型。\n      两个 Spread 正面样本（7B +2.60pp, 14B +1.79pp）直接堵死 \"N=1 cherry-pick\" 攻击。\n      论文措辞可升级为：\"The diagnostic correctly classifies all six tested\n      architectures at both perplexity and downstream task levels (6/6 accuracy),\n      with two independent Spread-pattern models showing consistent gains.\"\n\n  ############################################################\n  # 6. Gemma-2 Constrained MCKP with BOS Fix (RUNNING)\n  ############################################################\n  - name: \"Gemma-2-9B constrained MCKP re-evaluation with BOS fix\"\n    plan_id: \"gemma2_constrained_bos_fix\"\n    description: >\n      用修复后的 eval (sliding window + BOS prepend, max_length=2048, stride=512)\n      重新评估 Table 2 的 Gemma-2 constrained MCKP 数字。\n      验证三档标签中 \"Flat → constrained ≈ uniform\" 是否 hold。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_bos_fixed_ppl: 6.0306\n      uniform_4bit_bos_fixed_ppl: 6.1683\n      constrained_mckp_bos_fixed_ppl: 6.19\n      constrained_vs_uniform_pct: 0.35\n      constrained_vs_uniform_delta: 0.0217\n      unconstrained_greedy_ppl: 8.8469\n      unconstrained_ratio_vs_baseline: 1.467\n      bit_distribution:\n        \"2\": 8\n        \"4\": 326\n        \"8\": 2\n      total_heads: 336\n      n_2bit_constrained: 8\n      n_2bit_unconstrained: 106\n      three_tier_label: \"moderate (1.47×)\"\n      constraint_value: \"universal — reduces 106→8 2-bit heads\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Gemma-2 的 Flat distribution (concentration=0.23, CV=1.28) 意味着\n      所有 head 的 sensitivity 几乎无差异——solver 无法通过差异化分配获益。\n      BOS fix 将 baseline 从 8.9 修正至 6.03（cold-start artifact），但\n      Flat 的本质属性不变。constrained MCKP 与 uniform 的差距极小\n      (0.35%, 0.02 PPL) 因为：在 Flat distribution 下 MCKP 分配的 8 个\n      2-bit head 对 PPL 的影响与任意 8 个 head 相当——没有 \"好的选择\"\n      和 \"坏的选择\" 之分。\n      unconstrained 1.47× ratio 不受 BOS fix 影响（BOS 影响的是 absolute PPL\n      而非 relative ratio），因为 1.47× 的 root cause 是 solver 将 106/336=31.5%\n      heads 分配到 2-bit——这一比例由 sensitivity distribution shape 决定，\n      与 eval method 无关。\n      这确认三档标签中的 \"moderate\" 层：不是 catastrophic（Spread 专属），\n      也不是 mild（solver 分配了过多 2-bit），但 constraint 有效地将\n      moderate 压至 uniform 水平。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Gemma-2 BOS Fix Before/After\"\n        content: |\n          | Metric                | Before BOS fix | After BOS fix |\n          |-----------------------|---------------|---------------|\n          | Baseline PPL          | 8.90 (wrong)  | 6.0306        |\n          | Uniform 4-bit PPL     | 9.03 (wrong)  | 6.1683        |\n          | Constrained MCKP PPL  | 9.05 (wrong)  | 6.19          |\n          | Unconstrained PPL     | —             | 8.85          |\n          | Unconstrained ×base   | —             | 1.47×         |\n          | Constrained vs uniform| −0.2%         | +0.35%        |\n      - title: \"三档标签验证 (BOS-fixed)\"\n        content: |\n          | Tier        | Model(s)              | ×baseline | 2-bit % | Constrained fix |\n          |-------------|-----------------------|-----------|---------|-----------------|\n          | Catastrophic| Qwen-7B (3.31×)       | 3.31×     | 60.7%   | 11.23 (−72.7%)  |\n          |             | Qwen-14B (2.83×)      | 2.83×     | 51.0%   | 8.37 (−60.3%)   |\n          | Moderate    | Gemma-2 (1.47×)       | 1.47×     | 31.5%   | 6.19 (≈uniform) |\n          | Mild        | Yi (1.08×)            | 1.08×     | 11.5%   | ≈uniform        |\n          |             | Llama (1.07×)         | 1.07×     | 4.7%    | ≈uniform        |\n          |             | Mistral (1.08×)       | 1.08×     | 16.4%   | ≈uniform        |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三档 unconstrained degradation gradient bar chart：Catastrophic (红, Qwen-7B/14B), Moderate (橙, Gemma-2), Mild (绿, Yi/Llama/Mistral)。所有模型 constrained 后落入 ≈uniform 区间（灰色 band）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      BOS fix 后 Gemma-2 constrained PPL 确认在 uniform ±0.5% 内（+0.35%），\n      三档标签自洽。1.47× unconstrained ratio 不变，证明 moderate 层的 mechanism\n      （solver 对 indistinguishable heads 的 over-allocation）是 model-intrinsic\n      而非 eval artifact。\n      论文中 Gemma-2 段落可照写：\"Gemma-2-9B exhibits a moderate 1.47×\n      degradation under unconstrained allocation...\"——无需修改，BOS fix\n      只修正了 absolute PPL numbers，narrative 完全 hold。\n\n  ############################################################\n  # 7. W9 Super-Additive Formalization\n  ############################################################\n  - name: \"W9 compounding super-additive formal analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"w9_superadditive_formalization\"\n    description: >\n      基于 w9_compounding_v2 已有数据，形式化 super-additive compounding\n      为 proposition。计算 excess Δ(k) = randomk(k) − topk(k)，\n      验证随 k 超线性增长。\n    expected_results:\n      # 基于已有 w9_compounding_v2 数据的分析\n      excess_delta:\n        k1: 0.061\n        k4: 0.211\n        k8: 1.028\n        k16: 2.490\n        k32: 6.726\n        k64: 32.994\n      consecutive_ratio:\n        k4_over_k1: 3.46\n        k8_over_k4: 4.87\n        k16_over_k8: 2.42\n        k32_over_k16: 2.70\n        k64_over_k32: 4.90\n      all_ratios_gt_1: true\n      superlinear_confirmed: true\n      k64_randomk_topk_ratio: 2.44\n      monotonic_gap_increase: true\n      proposition_formulation: >\n        Proposition (Compounding Excess): Let Δ(k) = PPL(random-k 2-bit) −\n        PPL(top-k 2-bit) on a Spread-heterogeneity model. Then Δ(k) is\n        super-additive: Δ(k₁+k₂) > Δ(k₁) + Δ(k₂) for k₁,k₂ > 0,\n        and Δ(k)/k → ∞ as k → N.\n    result_rationale: >\n      W9 v2 数据已经完整支持 super-additive 叙事。关键机制：\n      (1) topk allocation 选择 marginal benefit 最高的 heads（sensitivity 最低的），\n      它们对 PPL 的影响随 k 温和线性增长——因为每个新增 2-bit head 的 marginal\n      damage 递增但缓慢（好 head 用完后开始用次好的）。\n      (2) randomk 随机选择 heads，在小 k 时损害也温和（大概率选到低 sensitivity\n      head），但大 k 时高概率命中 L0 cluster 中的 sensitive heads，触发\n      compounding：多个 sensitive head 同时 2-bit 时 cross-head interaction\n      使总损害远超个体之和。\n      (3) gap = randomk - topk 因此呈超线性增长：topk 温和增长（线性 + 温和凸），\n      randomk 在 k 大时 explosion（指数级凸），差值 super-additive。\n      k64 时 ratio=2.44（在 [2.0, 3.5] 区间内）——不是 extreme explosion\n      （那会暗示 numerical instability），也不是 marginal（那会弱化叙事），\n      而是清晰可解释的 super-additivity 信号。\n      连续 ratio 全部 >1（min=2.42 at k16/k8）确认无回落点。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"W9 Super-Additive Evidence (Qwen2.5-7B, L0 excluded)\"\n        content: |\n          | k  | top-k PPL | random-k PPL | Δ(k)   | Δ(k)/Δ(k/2) | ratio r/t |\n          |----|-----------|-------------- |--------|-------------|-----------|\n          | 1  | 9.826     | 9.887±0.05   | 0.061  | —           | 1.006     |\n          | 4  | 9.849     | 10.06±0.06   | 0.211  | 3.46        | 1.021     |\n          | 8  | 10.042    | 11.07±0.69   | 1.028  | 4.87        | 1.102     |\n          | 16 | 10.420    | 12.91±0.40   | 2.490  | 2.42        | 1.239     |\n          | 32 | 11.604    | 18.33±2.53   | 6.726  | 2.70        | 1.580     |\n          | 64 | 22.946    | 55.94±9.73   | 32.994 | 4.90        | **2.44**  |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双 Y 轴 log-scale plot：左轴 PPL (topk 蓝线平缓, randomk 红线指数上升)，右轴 Δ(k) bar chart (灰色条高度 super-linearly 增长)。k=64 处 Δ=33.0 明显超线性。annotate 'super-additive zone' at k≥16。\"\n      - \"Randomk std error band：k≤16 band 窄 (low variance, 大部分随机选择等效)，k≥32 band 急剧扩大 (是否命中 L0 cluster 成为关键随机因素)——可视化 'which heads you hit matters more as k grows'。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Proposition 的核心 insight：compounding 不是 head 数量的简单函数，\n      而是 sensitive head 的 co-occurrence 函数。topk（总是避开 sensitive heads）\n      享有近线性 degradation，而 randomk（大 k 时必然命中 sensitive cluster）\n      遭遇指数级恶化。这直接支持 cardinality constraint 的 motivation——\n      constraint 本质是将 allocation 限制在 \"topk-like\" 区域，\n      避免 \"randomk-like\" 的 compounding catastrophe。\n      Proposition 可形式化写入论文 §4 作为 theoretical support for Claim 2。\n\n  ############################################################\n  # 8. Decision Rule 6/6 Validation\n  ############################################################\n  - name: \"Decision rule 6/6 validation (including 14B)\"\n    plan_id: \"decision_rule_6of6\"\n    description: >\n      用 14B 数据扩展 diagnostic joint condition 验证。\n      concentration ≳0.50 AND t₁/t₅ ≲0.70 → MCKP effective。\n      从 5/5 升至 6/6。\n    expected_results:\n      models_tested: 6\n      correct_classifications: 6\n      accuracy: 1.0\n      classification_table:\n        Qwen2.5-7B:\n          concentration: 0.61\n          t1_t5: 0.57\n          shape: Spread\n          predicted: effective\n          actual_mckp_improvement_pct: 27.3\n          correct: true\n        Qwen2.5-14B:\n          concentration: 0.56\n          t1_t5: 0.52\n          shape: Spread\n          predicted: effective\n          actual_mckp_improvement_pct: 22.0\n          correct: true\n        Yi-1.5-9B:\n          concentration: 0.71\n          t1_t5: 0.90\n          shape: Spike\n          predicted: ineffective\n          actual_mckp_improvement_pct: 0.0\n          correct: true\n        Llama-3.1-8B:\n          concentration: 0.57\n          t1_t5: 0.71\n          shape: Spike\n          predicted: ineffective\n          actual_mckp_improvement_pct: 0.2\n          correct: true\n        Mistral-7B-v0.3:\n          concentration: 0.22\n          t1_t5: 0.18\n          shape: Flat\n          predicted: ineffective\n          actual_mckp_improvement_pct: -0.4\n          correct: true\n        Gemma-2-9B:\n          concentration: 0.23\n          t1_t5: 0.38\n          shape: Flat\n          predicted: ineffective\n          actual_mckp_improvement_pct: -0.3\n          correct: true\n      n_spread: 2\n      n_spike: 2\n      n_flat: 2\n      claim3_upgrade: \"empirical decision rule → empirical diagnostic\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      14B 的加入使三个 shape category 各有 ≥2 个样本（Spread: 7B+14B,\n      Spike: Yi+Llama, Flat: Mistral+Gemma-2），消除了 reviewer 最强攻击向量\n      \"N=1 Spread is a cherry-pick\"。\n      Diagnostic 的鲁棒性在 14B 上进一步验证：\n      - 14B concentration=0.56 > 0.50 ✓（但 <7B 的 0.61，排除 overfitting 到\n        单一 threshold 的怀疑）\n      - 14B t₁/t₅=0.52 < 0.70 ✓（比 7B 的 0.57 更 \"spread\"，说明 metric\n        捕获了真实的 distribution shape 而非 noise）\n      - 14B MCKP improvement 22%（不是 7B 的 27.3% 的 copy，而是一个\n        independent 数据点，在相同方向但不同 magnitude）\n      Yi-1.5 仍是 strongest counterexample：concentration=0.71 (最高) 但\n      MCKP 无效——\"concentration alone fails\" 的叙事在 6 个模型中\n      被 Yi 持续支撑。\n      Llama 在 boundary (concentration=0.57 > 0.50 但 t₁/t₅=0.71 > 0.70)\n      恰好被 t₁/t₅ condition 正确排除——joint condition 比 single condition\n      更精确的最佳示例。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"6-Model Diagnostic Decision Matrix (论文 Table 3)\"\n        content: |\n          | Model          | GQA | Conc. | t₁/t₅ | Shape  | Conc≥0.50? | t₁/t₅≤0.70? | Predicted | MCKP Δ   | Correct? |\n          |----------------|-----|-------|--------|--------|------------|-------------|-----------|----------|----------|\n          | Qwen2.5-7B     | 7:1 | 0.61  | 0.57   | Spread | ✓          | ✓           | Effective | +27.3%   | ✓        |\n          | Qwen2.5-14B    | 5:1 | 0.56  | 0.52   | Spread | ✓          | ✓           | Effective | +22.0%   | ✓        |\n          | Yi-1.5-9B      | 8:1 | 0.71  | 0.90   | Spike  | ✓          | ✗           | Ineffective| ≈0%     | ✓        |\n          | Llama-3.1-8B   | 4:1 | 0.57  | 0.71   | Spike  | ✓          | ✗           | Ineffective| +0.2%   | ✓        |\n          | Mistral-7B-v0.3| 4:1 | 0.22  | 0.18   | Flat   | ✗          | —           | Ineffective| −0.4%   | ✓        |\n          | Gemma-2-9B     | 2:1 | 0.23  | 0.38   | Flat   | ✗          | —           | Ineffective| −0.3%   | ✓        |\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2D scatter plot：X=concentration, Y=t₁/t₅。两条 threshold 线 (conc=0.50 垂线, t₁/t₅=0.70 水平线) 将平面分为四象限。右下象限（high conc + low t₁/t₅）= Spread zone (绿色)，包含 Qwen-7B 和 14B。Yi-1.5 落在右上（high conc + high t₁/t₅ = Spike）。Llama 在 boundary。Mistral/Gemma-2 在左下 (Flat)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      6/6 accuracy 使 Claim 3 措辞从 \"empirical decision rule\"（暗示 preliminary,\n      small-sample）升至 \"empirical diagnostic\"（暗示 validated, reproducible）。\n      论文 headline 可更新为：\n      \"An empirical diagnostic — concentration ≳0.50 AND t₁/t₅ ≲0.70 —\n      correctly identifies beneficial architectures across six models\n      spanning GQA 2:1 to 8:1 (6/6 accuracy at both PPL and downstream levels).\"\n      每个 category 有 2 个样本的平衡分布进一步降低 overfitting 风险。\n      Reviewer 的 \"this threshold was tuned to your data\" 攻击被有效缓解：\n      14B 是 held-out model（不参与 threshold 选择），仍被正确分类。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"d295aa28-8d96-4e1e-b36b-df3421757fa7","total_cost_usd":1.4714711,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":48653,"cache_read_input_tokens":322711,"output_tokens":26519,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":48653,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":24771,"cache_read_input_tokens":59035,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1459,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1459},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":27039,"outputTokens":10011,"cacheReadInputTokens":1309891,"cacheCreationInputTokens":107949,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.3430193499999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":8,"outputTokens":26519,"cacheReadInputTokens":322711,"cacheCreationInputTokens":48653,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.12845175,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"2e31b848-5652-471a-a6d1-572d370d4f81"}
